# Paths exempt from the local build-and-swap docker verification gate.
#
# One path prefix or glob per line. `**` is the only recursive form; a single
# `*` does not cross a `/`.
#
# docker-compose.yml builds two images: backend from ./backend and frontend
# from ./frontend. Each Dockerfile copies only from its own build context, and
# the compose file bind-mounts only ./backend and ./frontend into the running
# services. A change confined to the paths below cannot change either image or
# the running stack, so a build-and-swap run cannot observe it.
#
# Never listed: backend/, frontend/, docker-compose.yml and this file. The gate
# still applies unless EVERY changed file in the diff matches, and a diff that
# touches this file is never exempt.
#
# Dockerfile.allinone and the files it copies are not built by
# docker-compose.yml, so this gate cannot observe a change to them.

.github/**
ci/**
docs/**
examples/**
scripts/**
sdk/**
.env.example
.gitignore
.hmaignore
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
Dockerfile.allinone
LICENSE
README.md
SECURITY.md
docker-compose.production.yml
docker-compose.scale.yml
docker-entrypoint.sh
nginx.scale.conf
supervisord.conf
